  "VERDICT": "G3's committed artifact reports family-level SEM over 24 families in 6 domains, with no domain clustering -- the A11-12 fix applied to G1 was never applied to G3. Clustering changes interval widths by x0.78 to x1.68. It UNDERSTATES most for the two arms that carry the claim (no_demo_text x1.68, all_layers_demo x1.21) and slightly OVERSTATES for several near-null arms (bottomk x0.78, random_demo x0.92, all_demo x0.94) -- so this is not a uniform understatement, and an earlier draft of this field said it was.",
